WEBVTT

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:19.200
<i>C'mon, morning's here--time to be on our way</i>

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:24.700
<i>Smiling faces, courage,</i>
<i>we're bustin' out: glory days!</i>

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:29.830
<i>You ready or not? Ready or not, go!</i>
<i>No turning back: this trip is nonfiction</i>

00:00:29.830 --> 00:00:35.080
<i>You ready or not? Ready or not, go!</i>
<i>It's now or never, the real deal: Ready, and... action!</i>

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:40.540
<i>Harsh winds that make us hesitate,</i>
<i>nights spent crying our eyes out</i>

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:45.790
<i>They're not necessarily bad things (not bad)</i>

00:00:45.790 --> 00:00:51.500
<i>Just like the power in a spring:</i>
<i>the harder we're pushed</i>

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:55.040
<i>The higher we can fly</i>

00:00:55.040 --> 00:01:05.580
<i>Face the far-off distance</i>
<i>and aim for the horizon: rising sun</i>

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:10.870
<i>Holding our hands up to that morning sun</i>

00:01:10.870 --> 00:01:21.250
<i>Our shared feelings brought us together--</i>
<i>we're not alone anymore</i>

00:01:21.250 --> 00:01:27.450
<i>And so we're on this brilliant voyage</i>

00:01:27.450 --> 00:01:34.250
<i>Smiling faces, courage,</i>
<i>we're bustin' out: glory days!</i>

00:01:42.330 --> 00:01:46.040
The 80 thousand troops
under Chin general Mou Gou

00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:49.950
had surrounded their first Gi target,
Gao Lang Castle.

00:01:51.620 --> 00:01:56.160
Shin's Hi Shin Unit was serving
in the eastern army's reserves,

00:01:56.160 --> 00:02:05.040
alongside Ou Hon's Gyoku Hou Force
and Mou Ten's Gaku Ka Force.

00:02:05.410 --> 00:02:07.700
Now the assault on Gao Lang Castle was underway,

00:02:07.700 --> 00:02:10.200
right before the very eyes
of these three young soldiers

00:02:10.200 --> 00:02:14.160
who would usher in a new era for Chin!

00:02:14.160 --> 00:02:15.330
However...

00:02:15.330 --> 00:02:16.330
Fire!

00:02:18.330 --> 00:02:19.450
Wh--

00:02:19.450 --> 00:02:20.450
What the--?!

00:02:23.080 --> 00:02:25.250
What's with all these arrows?!

00:02:26.080 --> 00:02:27.330
I knew it.

00:02:28.750 --> 00:02:30.160
Yep. A trap.

00:02:36.750 --> 00:02:41.750
"The Siege of Gao Lang Castle"

00:02:53.120 --> 00:02:56.250
There's a huge squad of archers
hiding behind the walls!

00:02:56.250 --> 00:02:57.580
Ready!

00:03:01.450 --> 00:03:02.660
Fire!

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:15.830
Our comrades! They'll be--

00:03:15.830 --> 00:03:19.200
Watch where you move. It's safer over here.

00:03:19.200 --> 00:03:21.750
I know--but still!

00:03:22.870 --> 00:03:26.830
Don't falter! Clear the wall
and we'll have our chance for victory!

00:03:30.910 --> 00:03:32.620
All right! Hi Shin Unit, onward!

00:03:37.230 --> 00:03:42.240
"Fuu Haku, General of Gi"
"East Wall Commander, Gao Lang Castle"

00:03:41.290 --> 00:03:43.080
General Fuu Haku, sir.

00:03:43.080 --> 00:03:47.160
The Chin monkeys are still
fighting their way up the ladders!

00:03:54.660 --> 00:03:57.200
Take <i>this</i> , you Chin imbeciles!

00:04:11.950 --> 00:04:12.950
Ow...

00:04:13.580 --> 00:04:15.700
Are you all right, Shin?

00:04:15.700 --> 00:04:19.160
Yeah... but <i>now</i> what do we do?

00:04:20.410 --> 00:04:23.790
The battle was in its third day.
In the blink of an eye,

00:04:23.790 --> 00:04:27.700
the Gi army's traps had backed
the Chin troops into a tight corner.

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:30.080
Those fools...

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:31.620
It stands to reason:

00:04:31.620 --> 00:04:35.450
the four generals guarding
the four walls of Gao Lang Castle

00:04:35.450 --> 00:04:38.910
were all renowned military men
well-versed in castle defense.

00:04:40.250 --> 00:04:41.830
Report! Report!

00:04:42.950 --> 00:04:46.750
The east army is reporting
major casualties--as is the south army!

00:04:46.750 --> 00:04:49.330
Lieutenant Sun has suffered arrow wounds!

00:04:50.660 --> 00:04:54.160
Commanding Chin general Mou Gou
was informed immediately

00:04:54.160 --> 00:04:57.540
of the setbacks at the
start of the battle. However...

00:05:01.040 --> 00:05:04.160
Then this is for the four generals:

00:05:04.160 --> 00:05:09.370
"Don't forget to pay a visit
to the wounded squads afterward."

00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:14.080
Pay... a visit?

00:05:14.080 --> 00:05:17.200
Yes, pay a visit! Tell them that.

00:05:17.200 --> 00:05:18.200
Sir!

00:05:23.290 --> 00:05:27.080
Retreat! Retreat! Fall back for now!

00:05:28.830 --> 00:05:31.580
Now the scene changes to the capital, Kanyou.

00:05:32.750 --> 00:05:36.160
On the same day that the battle
with Gi sparked into action,

00:05:36.160 --> 00:05:40.160
a new piece of kindling was
starting to smolder at the Royal Court.

00:05:41.580 --> 00:05:44.910
But that's ridiculous!
The Queen Dowager and the Minister?!

00:05:44.910 --> 00:05:46.790
Shh! Keep your voice down!

00:05:46.790 --> 00:05:49.250
Is the story true?

00:05:49.250 --> 00:05:51.330
Indeed. As it happens--

00:05:51.330 --> 00:05:55.000
What story is this? Let's hear it.

00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:56.620
R-Ri Shi, sir!

00:05:56.620 --> 00:06:01.580
I-It's nothing--just an insignificant rumor.

00:06:01.580 --> 00:06:04.540
Kingdoms have been lost
to malicious false rumors,

00:06:04.540 --> 00:06:06.410
given the right time and place.

00:06:07.450 --> 00:06:09.080
Mind your tongues!

00:06:09.080 --> 00:06:11.580
Begging your pardon, Ri Shi, sir.

00:06:11.580 --> 00:06:14.200
We have business to attend to,
so if you'll excuse us...

00:06:21.540 --> 00:06:23.370
Honestly, that lot...

00:06:33.160 --> 00:06:34.830
Unfortunately, Minister...

00:06:36.080 --> 00:06:39.620
there has been a rumor
going around these past few days

00:06:39.620 --> 00:06:43.410
that you and the Queen Dowager have been...

00:06:43.410 --> 00:06:45.080
indiscreet.

00:06:50.160 --> 00:06:51.830
What...?

00:06:51.830 --> 00:06:54.000
An unforgivably evil rumor!

00:06:54.000 --> 00:06:56.330
Why, accusing the Minister of such improprieties

00:06:56.330 --> 00:07:01.410
is tantamount to calling him a traitor!
We cannot let this stand!

00:07:01.410 --> 00:07:05.830
Indeed! This will not end well
for any who spread such wild nonsense!

00:07:07.910 --> 00:07:10.410
If you'll pardon my rudeness...

00:07:10.410 --> 00:07:16.160
surely you can think of nothing
that could spark such rumors,

00:07:16.160 --> 00:07:17.830
can you, Minister?

00:07:22.160 --> 00:07:24.870
What are you driving at, Ri Shi?

00:07:29.620 --> 00:07:32.950
Forgive me. The details of this rumor alone

00:07:32.950 --> 00:07:36.750
have caused not a little
consternation among your faction.

00:07:36.750 --> 00:07:40.370
It was necessary to put them at ease.

00:07:40.370 --> 00:07:46.160
Fine, then. Now go and quash
that vulgar rumor at once.

00:07:46.160 --> 00:07:52.250
I shall do just that.
A rumor so baseless and wild spreads quickly,

00:07:52.250 --> 00:07:54.160
but is easily contained.

00:07:55.620 --> 00:07:57.200
Besides...

00:07:57.200 --> 00:08:00.330
I suspect we know whence it came.

00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:06.500
Are you sure about this rumor business, sire?

00:08:08.580 --> 00:08:13.120
Indeed, it is shaking the
foundations of Ryo Fui's faction,

00:08:13.120 --> 00:08:16.540
but at the same time,
it has muddied the name of your mother,

00:08:16.540 --> 00:08:18.120
the Queen Dowager.

00:08:18.120 --> 00:08:23.080
Although she had already
made herself your enemy...

00:08:23.080 --> 00:08:25.500
Aren't you attempting the impossible, sire?

00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:48.080
It would be a lie to say I am not.

00:08:48.080 --> 00:08:51.870
She may be a bad mother,
but I am still flesh of her flesh.

00:08:53.160 --> 00:08:54.410
But what of it?

00:08:56.700 --> 00:08:58.540
We are fighting a war!

00:08:59.700 --> 00:09:04.450
We must be prepared for our
allies' bloodshed, for our own injuries,

00:09:04.450 --> 00:09:07.750
ready and willing to use any means necessary!

00:09:07.750 --> 00:09:12.750
Even if those means come back to bite me,
I will not hesitate!

00:09:12.750 --> 00:09:15.410
Now that we're in the fight,
we absolutely must win.

00:09:16.290 --> 00:09:19.700
You're the one who taught me that about war,

00:09:19.700 --> 00:09:22.040
Shou Bun Kun.

00:09:25.830 --> 00:09:29.000
We have already lost so many...

00:09:29.000 --> 00:09:31.540
Now is no time for me to flinch.

00:09:31.540 --> 00:09:34.000
Shi Shi, how is it coming along?

00:09:34.000 --> 00:09:37.790
I believe things are just
about to start moving, sire.

00:09:37.790 --> 00:09:43.000
Ryo Fui's faction likely believes
this rumor will soon fade away,

00:09:43.000 --> 00:09:46.160
but now it seems it's
ushering in yet another storm.

00:09:53.370 --> 00:09:54.540
Look!

00:09:57.290 --> 00:10:00.250
Lord Ri Shi! A-Are those...

00:10:02.080 --> 00:10:04.660
The houses of Ryou, Han, and Kai!

00:10:04.660 --> 00:10:07.500
But what are the
three royal families doing here?!

00:10:07.500 --> 00:10:09.540
What could this mean?

00:10:09.540 --> 00:10:11.500
Lord Ri Shi!

00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:13.200
How absurd...

00:10:13.200 --> 00:10:17.040
Anyone could see how unnatural
it would be for the Queen Dowager

00:10:17.040 --> 00:10:20.870
to lend her support to the faction
led by her son's enemy!

00:10:22.040 --> 00:10:26.370
This must mean the rumors
were telling the truth!

00:10:26.370 --> 00:10:28.250
What on earth is going on?

00:10:33.120 --> 00:10:37.080
What do you find so amusing, madam?

00:10:42.330 --> 00:10:45.200
This letter from Ryo Fui.

00:10:45.200 --> 00:10:49.660
He says he cannot meet with me
until everything blows over.

00:10:49.660 --> 00:10:54.160
Hmph. That was fast.

00:10:54.160 --> 00:10:56.950
Surely it can't be helped.

00:11:00.040 --> 00:11:05.370
Bring me the finest perfumed oil--
and prepare for an outing.

00:11:05.370 --> 00:11:07.040
Where to, madam?

00:11:07.040 --> 00:11:09.660
Where else?

00:11:09.660 --> 00:11:14.750
If he won't come to me,
I shall just have to go to him.

00:11:20.000 --> 00:11:23.370
You may already have heard:

00:11:23.370 --> 00:11:25.370
The Inner Palace has seen fit to double-cross us

00:11:25.370 --> 00:11:26.870
and side with Ryo Fui instead.

00:11:27.910 --> 00:11:33.620
This means the power gap between us
is now too great for us to overcome.

00:11:33.620 --> 00:11:37.660
However, Ryo Fui made a
grave mistake in securing their help:

00:11:37.660 --> 00:11:40.910
While serving as the
kingdom's highest-ranked Minister,

00:11:40.910 --> 00:11:44.410
he committed adultery
with the Queen Dowager of Chin!

00:11:45.540 --> 00:11:49.290
This is an unprecedented act of base immorality,

00:11:49.290 --> 00:11:51.250
a traitorous act,

00:11:51.250 --> 00:11:53.540
an evil act that shall not be countenanced!

00:11:56.580 --> 00:11:59.370
Unfortunately, as the only
witness is a single court lady,

00:11:59.370 --> 00:12:02.080
taking his head would not be feasible.

00:12:02.080 --> 00:12:05.700
However, Ryo Fui's faction
has been shaken to its core.

00:12:05.700 --> 00:12:09.950
A wedge of never-before-seen
proportions has been driven

00:12:09.950 --> 00:12:13.790
into his stronghold,
severely restricting Ryo Fui's actions.

00:12:13.790 --> 00:12:17.370
We will seize this opportunity
to recover from our setback!

00:12:18.290 --> 00:12:19.250
Understood?

00:12:19.250 --> 00:12:22.620
We have justice on our side! Never forget that!

00:12:25.500 --> 00:12:29.000
Son Sen, work with Ryuu Kai
to undercut the neutrals!

00:12:29.000 --> 00:12:30.000
Sir!

00:12:30.410 --> 00:12:32.660
Tun, convince the neutrals to come to our side!

00:12:32.660 --> 00:12:33.580
Leave it to us!

00:12:33.580 --> 00:12:36.290
Shou, muster some soldiers
into a reserve force, just in case!

00:12:36.290 --> 00:12:39.370
They won't be pulling any punches!

00:12:40.540 --> 00:12:42.620
Here's where the real battle begins.

00:12:43.750 --> 00:12:46.370
There's no turning back now!

00:12:48.240 --> 00:12:52.000
"Shin"

00:12:52.870 --> 00:12:55.790
What the hell is up with that wall?!

00:12:55.790 --> 00:12:57.950
Some fight this turned out to be!

00:12:57.950 --> 00:13:01.040
Come too close and we'll
get a hide full of arrows!

00:13:01.040 --> 00:13:03.540
Those arrows are a real pain!

00:13:03.540 --> 00:13:06.370
We haven't lost anyone, Shin,

00:13:06.370 --> 00:13:08.700
but some twenty men are out of commission.

00:13:10.700 --> 00:13:15.660
Haven't we received any orders from above?

00:13:15.660 --> 00:13:18.750
Those ladders are prime targets for the enemy.

00:13:18.750 --> 00:13:21.540
I doubt we can storm the castle
using those alone.

00:13:21.540 --> 00:13:23.450
Haven't heard a thing...

00:13:23.450 --> 00:13:28.750
You can't tell me General Mou Gou
is outta options!

00:13:28.750 --> 00:13:30.870
If we don't get some kind of strategy and soon,

00:13:30.870 --> 00:13:32.290
this is just gonna drag on!

00:13:32.290 --> 00:13:36.700
Haku Rou hasn't put together
any clever strategies or anything.

00:13:37.870 --> 00:13:40.000
Mou Ten of the Gaku Ka Force!

00:13:40.000 --> 00:13:41.040
Hiya!

00:13:41.450 --> 00:13:46.830
Ace castle-buster Haku Rou uses
only conventional tactics in his battles.

00:13:46.830 --> 00:13:48.910
Surround the castle, patiently chip away at it,

00:13:48.910 --> 00:13:52.200
lower the enemy's morale,
then strike at the rift we've made.

00:13:52.200 --> 00:13:53.540
That's it.

00:13:53.540 --> 00:13:55.250
"Patiently"?!

00:13:55.250 --> 00:13:57.700
Like we're gonna stand for goin' that slow!

00:13:57.700 --> 00:14:01.540
And the longer the fight drags on,
the more men we'll lose--

00:14:01.540 --> 00:14:03.580
and the less provisions we'll have!

00:14:03.580 --> 00:14:08.750
Besides, shouldn't we special forces
be usin' not-so-conventional tactics?

00:14:10.500 --> 00:14:13.410
You do have a point there.

00:14:13.410 --> 00:14:16.000
But practically speaking,
there really isn't any other way

00:14:16.000 --> 00:14:18.750
to bring down a wall with three hundred troops.

00:14:18.750 --> 00:14:22.250
We'll just have to resign ourselves
to a long and drawn-out fight.

00:14:22.250 --> 00:14:24.450
In other words, until those castle gates open,

00:14:24.450 --> 00:14:28.700
we reserves have precisely nothing to do.

00:14:28.700 --> 00:14:30.410
Yeah, but...

00:14:30.410 --> 00:14:32.750
Just be patient and wait your turn, okay?

00:14:34.870 --> 00:14:36.450
See you!

00:14:40.000 --> 00:14:42.910
Why the hell did he come out here, anyway?

00:14:42.910 --> 00:14:44.120
Good question...

00:14:44.120 --> 00:14:46.750
Maybe he likes you.

00:14:46.750 --> 00:14:48.580
What, him?

00:14:48.580 --> 00:14:51.700
Yeah, right. What makes you say that, Kyou Kai?

00:14:52.750 --> 00:14:54.080
No reason.

00:14:54.080 --> 00:14:55.700
Oh, yeah?

00:14:55.700 --> 00:14:59.040
Man, I just don't get him.

00:15:02.870 --> 00:15:06.080
Mou Ten was right:
The tide of battle still hadn't budged

00:15:06.080 --> 00:15:07.790
even ten days in.

00:15:07.790 --> 00:15:10.540
Retreat! Retreat!

00:15:10.540 --> 00:15:13.410
But Mou Gou showed no signs of panicking.

00:15:15.370 --> 00:15:19.450
Don't rush, now! Slow and steady--
that's how to do it.

00:15:19.450 --> 00:15:22.080
A castle can't run away.

00:15:22.080 --> 00:15:27.330
And with that, the army was told
to expect a full month of fighting.

00:15:28.500 --> 00:15:32.290
But the Chin troops were clearly anxious,

00:15:32.290 --> 00:15:33.950
and their morale had fallen.

00:15:36.500 --> 00:15:39.250
Meanwhile, the Gi army's
morale was only increasing,

00:15:39.250 --> 00:15:42.950
thanks to their success in holding off
the Chin army day after day.

00:15:48.250 --> 00:15:51.330
It has arrived at last, my lord.

00:15:51.330 --> 00:15:52.330
Ah.

00:15:55.160 --> 00:15:57.120
Do you hear that? That sound?

00:16:02.620 --> 00:16:03.950
Tomorrow, then.

00:16:03.950 --> 00:16:04.950
Yes.

00:16:09.160 --> 00:16:12.650
"The Castle Siege: Day 11"

00:16:28.250 --> 00:16:30.950
It's the Gyoku Hou Force! They're out ahead!

00:16:30.950 --> 00:16:36.080
Is he dense?! What good
is the cavalry at a castle wall?

00:16:36.080 --> 00:16:37.830
No--look closer.

00:16:40.580 --> 00:16:42.410
They're carryin' stuff on carts!

00:16:43.330 --> 00:16:44.660
Those aren't just carts.

00:16:48.200 --> 00:16:49.410
Trees?!

00:16:49.410 --> 00:16:52.080
What the hell are they tryin' to do?

00:16:52.080 --> 00:16:55.250
All those in position, take cover at once!

00:16:57.330 --> 00:16:58.450
Fire!

00:17:05.200 --> 00:17:07.080
A-A fire attack?!

00:17:07.080 --> 00:17:08.700
Fantastic!

00:17:08.700 --> 00:17:12.290
But those walls won't burn!

00:17:12.290 --> 00:17:14.080
That's no fire attack.

00:17:21.120 --> 00:17:23.080
General, the front!

00:17:23.080 --> 00:17:24.370
Keep your head!

00:17:24.370 --> 00:17:28.120
We're not the only ones this
smoke and fire is working against!

00:17:28.120 --> 00:17:32.040
That Ou Hon is gonna try usin'
this smoke to climb the walls!

00:17:32.040 --> 00:17:33.250
We'll do the same!

00:17:34.580 --> 00:17:36.410
Wait! We can't!

00:17:37.750 --> 00:17:39.370
Ro En?

00:17:39.370 --> 00:17:44.500
There's no climbing those ladders
amid the smoke and flames.

00:17:44.500 --> 00:17:46.830
If we go, we'll only be burned to a crisp!

00:17:46.830 --> 00:17:48.750
But isn't that why Ou Hon--

00:17:53.120 --> 00:17:55.160
What... what's that sound?

00:18:05.790 --> 00:18:08.120
The forest! The forest is moving!

00:18:33.450 --> 00:18:36.160
We can't attack with all these flames and smoke!

00:18:36.160 --> 00:18:38.910
Put out the fires at once!

00:18:38.910 --> 00:18:41.080
Eh? What's that?

00:18:41.080 --> 00:18:42.620
Sir?

00:18:42.620 --> 00:18:44.290
That noise. What could it...

00:18:53.750 --> 00:18:56.040
Wh-What in blazes--

00:19:13.790 --> 00:19:14.830
Huh?!

00:19:27.080 --> 00:19:28.330
Gyoku Hou Force...

00:19:32.080 --> 00:19:33.080
Onward!

00:19:46.160 --> 00:19:48.540
What gives, Ou Hon?

00:19:49.330 --> 00:19:52.540
Did you seriously bring that monster with you?!

00:19:54.200 --> 00:19:58.000
Is that a... a siege tower?

00:19:58.000 --> 00:19:59.450
Yep.

00:19:59.450 --> 00:20:02.830
Figures the Ou clan
would have something so unusual.

00:20:02.830 --> 00:20:05.370
And how clever of them to have brought it!

00:20:05.370 --> 00:20:06.870
Though it <i>is</i> a bit much.

00:20:12.200 --> 00:20:15.870
Stay calm! There are only
a hundred or two of them, at most!

00:20:15.870 --> 00:20:18.500
Surround them and drive them
into a corner--that's all it takes!

00:20:18.500 --> 00:20:21.250
Send every last one of them
plummeting to the ground!

00:20:22.870 --> 00:20:24.040
It won't work.

00:20:39.830 --> 00:20:45.580
With Ou Hon's spear skills,
not even ten men can get anywhere near him.

00:20:45.580 --> 00:20:46.830
Plus...

00:20:46.830 --> 00:20:49.660
Tear those Chin monkeys to pieces!

00:20:51.660 --> 00:20:54.450
...every last man on that squad
is a master soldier.

00:20:59.540 --> 00:21:00.870
And what's more,

00:21:00.870 --> 00:21:04.870
the Gyoku Hou Force uses high-level
group fighting techniques

00:21:04.870 --> 00:21:09.950
giving them raw power far beyond
that of Gi's thousand-man squads.

00:21:14.200 --> 00:21:18.870
Even without their horses,
the Gyoku Hou Force is a damn powerhouse!

00:21:19.540 --> 00:21:22.250
I can tell from here, Ou Hon.

00:21:22.250 --> 00:21:25.330
You guys've really been
perfecting your group fighting.

00:21:26.330 --> 00:21:30.450
Report! The east army has begun its attack!

00:21:30.450 --> 00:21:34.790
The Gyoku Hou Force has scaled
the wall and is fighting hard!

00:21:34.790 --> 00:21:38.790
Gyoku Hou? Ou Hon's 300-man squadron...

00:21:40.120 --> 00:21:44.160
Doesn't he have a history of disobeying orders?

00:21:44.160 --> 00:21:48.830
Well, if he leads us to victory,
I'm sure that can be overlooked.

00:21:51.290 --> 00:21:56.330
The vigor of youth is so delightful!

00:21:56.330 --> 00:21:58.290
However...

00:21:58.290 --> 00:22:03.700
let's hope he won't go too far
and lose his life in the process.

00:22:05.450 --> 00:22:08.290
It's too dangerous, sir! We must evacuate!

00:22:11.330 --> 00:22:13.910
I want all reserves here, now!

00:22:13.910 --> 00:22:18.700
I'll show those young upstarts
just how fearsome Gi soldiers can be!

00:22:20.500 --> 00:22:23.450
Their general is <i>mad</i> !
I heard him all the way out here!

00:22:25.580 --> 00:22:26.870
Shin, look!

00:22:28.160 --> 00:22:29.160
What is it?!

00:22:31.830 --> 00:22:34.790
The Gyoku Hou Force finally gained a foothold,

00:22:34.790 --> 00:22:37.200
but the ladder brigade isn't following up on it.

00:22:38.290 --> 00:22:39.790
I bet...

00:22:39.790 --> 00:22:41.410
...this was the
Gyoku Hou Force's own sneak attack,

00:22:41.410 --> 00:22:43.620
one the other squads don't know about.

00:22:43.620 --> 00:22:47.870
Even your allies would jump to see
<i>that</i> giant thing show up out here.

00:22:47.870 --> 00:22:49.370
But that means...

00:22:49.370 --> 00:22:50.370
Uh-huh:

00:22:53.910 --> 00:22:57.660
The Gyoku Hou Force is alone
and helpless with that big army!

00:22:57.660 --> 00:23:01.700
But it's all gone according to plan so far.

00:23:08.620 --> 00:23:11.370
Why don't we just see what you can do

00:23:11.370 --> 00:23:13.200
from up there,

00:23:13.200 --> 00:23:14.290
Ou Hon.

00:23:48.830 --> 00:23:51.750
<i>What do you think?</i>

00:23:51.750 --> 00:23:54.830
<i>Why would the voice that melted into the sky</i>

00:23:54.830 --> 00:23:59.450
<i>Peel away and disappear?</i>

00:24:00.790 --> 00:24:03.790
<i>Just a single word</i>

00:24:03.790 --> 00:24:06.830
<i>If that's all you'd say</i>

00:24:06.830 --> 00:24:11.700
<i>What kind of word would you choose?</i>

00:24:12.540 --> 00:24:15.910
<i>Holding my breath and making sure</i>

00:24:15.910 --> 00:24:18.870
<i>The heartbeat can't wait</i>

00:24:18.870 --> 00:24:24.830
<i>If I let go of your hand, I'll want even more</i>

00:24:24.830 --> 00:24:28.450
<i>And so I keep on doing this</i>

00:24:28.450 --> 00:24:30.910
<i>Not allowing myself to stop</i>

00:24:30.910 --> 00:24:35.700
<i>Because I'm still searching for answers</i>

00:24:35.700 --> 00:24:39.370
<i>I want you to tell me</i>

00:24:41.700 --> 00:24:46.200
<i>Before you melt away into the sky</i>

00:24:52.000 --> 00:24:58.010
"Next Episode Preview"

00:25:02.000 --> 00:25:07.020
"The Way I Fight"
